# ==========================================================================
# C.Lab website — what stays local
#
# This repository is the public website and nothing else. Brand source
# artwork, client documents, plans, transcripts and working files are kept
# out of it deliberately: this repo is world readable and is served at
# clab.iriscocreative.com.
#
# Put anything that should not be published in _local/. It will never be
# committed, and it sits alongside the site so it is easy to work with.
# ==========================================================================

# Local working directories — never published
_local/
_brand/
_client/
_drafts/

# Design and document source files
*.sketch
*.fig
*.ai
*.eps
*.psd
*.indd
*.afdesign
*.afphoto
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.key
*.pages
*.numbers
*.xlsx

# Internal planning and notes
*-BUILD.md
*-PLAN.md
NOTES.md
TODO.md
transcripts/
meeting-notes/

# Raw media awaiting selection and compression.
# Optimised, site-ready assets belong in assets/img/ and are committed.
_raw-media/
*.mov
*.mp4
*.zip

# Credentials — nothing here should ever exist, but guard anyway
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key.json

# OS and editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Tooling output (none today)
node_modules/
dist/
.cache/
